  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxQRTBxS2VmX3gzd05WY3BybkhEYmZqNzg1M3FwcXRvUXI0bUdNUmFRcWFEa1FUZnJnZXl2ZmJtN2xLZUt0aWhNZ1dnV0Y5aVJJdGh6b2U4aUx4QW5lc1N1T0ExUC1jTjh6emgzUWtaTF9WRlVKeFVxdlJXd2hFVmlrWDBYaVJxN3lZbThoMXpHYnd2SGRDTXNOY0J6RjFjX1FmTVY1VjIwZktQcjZ4Njd6cTR0bWs0ZEl4WVYxYnIwTlA1eXk3UXdIU2NRbw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Maya Protocol exploit drains bitcoin and other assets as pool value drops by $11 million</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/08/21/nomura-backed-laser-digital-wins-japan-s-first-crypto-approval-in-four-years\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nomura-backed Laser Digital wins Japan&#x27;s first crypto approval in four years</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxQVlhSYXNoNjhLZEpHMXpYMkpVYWRvRUJKSGJxMWFDTlJEZVhLbEctbEJQZ2xHLWYwbldzMFZDUHZOQ2lFeVg0OENoMkdaTnJGNlFqVmtERGxGMTNJR1NXcnhQbnREM1JFQl9aXzVyanBkYjFISHphZkkxcmZtYm5sQWF3Zmw0dE9CaURRMjRiRjZwNFE0RExuX3JySUVSWlZlMUllOVRCTE1FX3lQMk5oekIwRkZjbUNOaW50ZkJySUNiRERaZlNnSF9oYw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Grayscale moves closer to launching first Zcash ETF in US with fresh amended SEC filing</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
